{"nodes": [{"id": "_impeccable_review_explore_desktop_2", "label": "Explore Page - Desktop Rendered Plate (Stage 01)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": ".impeccable/review/explore-desktop-2.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Primary desktop composition: hero title + three-column metadata row, large plate viewer left, two stacked reference panels right (Source Record, Signal Path), transport bar below, and a persistent NOT LIVE footer. Purpose is a museum-label layout - the artifact dominates, provenance annotates it."}, {"id": "_impeccable_review_explore_desktop_2_plate_01_global", "label": "Plate 01 / Global Viewer", "file_type": "image", "source_file": ".impeccable/review/explore-desktop-2.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "2048x1024 plate shown inside a bordered frame with corner registration ticks and a caption strip naming the source (NASA SVS / Greg Shirah) and the frame timestamp. Corners + caption make the image read as a scientific plate rather than a hero graphic."}, {"id": "_impeccable_review_explore_desktop_2_source_record_panel", "label": "Source Record Panel", "file_type": "image", "source_file": ".impeccable/review/explore-desktop-2.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Key/value ledger (Visualization, Record SVS 3912, Publisher, Model, Period, Credit, Plate frame, Plate file) with a VERIFIED status dot, an 'Open NASA record' external link, and a 'Validated 14 Nov 2026' stamp. Duplicates provenance inline so the viewer never has to leave the plate to check it."}, {"id": "_impeccable_review_explore_desktop_2_signal_path_panel", "label": "Signal Path Panel (04 Stages)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".impeccable/review/explore-desktop-2.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Exposes the four-stage sonification pipeline (01 Numerical field, 02 Normalize, 03 Map, 04 Audio graph) with per-stage status chips - NOT CONNECTED, PENDING, PENDING, NOT IMPLEMENTED - and the closing note 'The path stops at the field boundary. No scientific value reaches the audio layer in this stage.' Showing the unfinished pipeline is the honesty mechanism; it converts an absence of audio into visible, legible state."}, {"id": "_impeccable_review_explore_desktop_2_sonification_transport", "label": "Sonification Transport (Offline)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": ".impeccable/review/explore-desktop-2.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Disabled transport bar with OFFLINE chip, 'Audio engine not implemented. Stage 02 will map verified ECCO2 fields to Web Audio; playback stays disabled until then.', a NOT SYNCHRONIZED timeline, speed control (0.5x/1x/2x) and two layer toggles greyed out. Ships the final control surface in a disabled state so the affordance is not invented later."}, {"id": "_impeccable_review_explore_desktop_2_read_plate_as_rendering", "label": "Read the Plate as a Rendering (Callout)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".impeccable/review/explore-desktop-2.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Inline anti-misreading callout: 'Pixel colors are not measurements. The image is NASA's rendered visualization; numerical ECCO2 fields are not connected in this stage.' with a link to data provenance. Placed at the moment of looking, not buried in an About page."}, {"id": "_impeccable_review_explore_desktop_2_not_live_disclaimer", "label": "NOT LIVE Disclaimer (Historical Model Output)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".impeccable/review/explore-desktop-2.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Repeated at four altitudes - nav badge 'STAGE 01 / VISUAL ONLY', hero bullet 'HISTORICAL MODEL OUTPUT - 26 MAR 2007 - 03 MAR 2008 - NOT LIVE', plate header 'RENDERED VISUALIZATION - NOT LIVE', and the page footer 'NOTHING ON THIS SCREEN IS A LIVE OCEAN OBSERVATION.' Repetition is deliberate: any single occurrence could be scrolled past."}, {"id": "_impeccable_review_explore_desktop_2_header_metadata_row", "label": "Hero Metadata Row (Model / Period / Coverage)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": ".impeccable/review/explore-desktop-2.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "_impeccable_review_explore_desktop_2", "target": "_impeccable_review_explore_desktop_2_plate_01_global", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".impeccable/review/explore-desktop-2.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_impeccable_review_explore_desktop_2", "target": "_impeccable_review_explore_desktop_2_source_record_panel", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".impeccable/review/explore-desktop-2.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_impeccable_review_explore_desktop_2", "target": "_impeccable_review_explore_desktop_2_signal_path_panel", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".impeccable/review/explore-desktop-2.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_impeccable_review_explore_desktop_2", "target": "_impeccable_review_explore_desktop_2_sonification_transport", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".impeccable/review/explore-desktop-2.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_impeccable_review_explore_desktop_2", "target